<title>POLAND: Polish budget gap narrows to PLN 4.91 bln in Nov.</title>
<headline>Polish budget gap narrows to PLN 4.91 bln in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish budget deficit narrowed by about 1.5 billion zlotys to 4.91 billion zlotys in November, which accounted for 48.3 percent of the planned 1996 deficit of 10.16 billion zlotys, the finance ministry said in a statement. </p>
<p> POLISH BUDGET GAP   Jan-Nov	    Jan-Oct     1996 plan</p>
<p> balance in bln PLN	-4.91	     -6.41	-10.16</p>
<p> revenue		     89.87	     79.86	100.17</p>
<p> expenditure		 94.78	     86.28	110.33</p>
<p>NOTE: Jan-prev figures given as reported last month.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
